+// lx:begin oom-snapshot-safe
+// The pprof writers reach into runtime internals through linkname. Inside the iOS
+// Network Extension (50 MiB limit) the heap writer crashed with a nil dereference in
+// writeHeapProto the moment memory pressure fired, turning a warning into a dead VPN.
+// Profiles are not written; the rest of the report (log, runtime info, connections)
+// still is.
+var oomProfilesDisabled = true
+
